- If current AI gets ball-in-hand after a foul: set ballInHand true, handPos maybe, state='ballInHand'; then beginTurn sees AI -> aiThinking. In loop, placement.

`resolveShot()`:
Detailed rules. Let's write carefully.

Before resolve, ensure drop animations? fine.

```js
const shot=this.shot;
const p=this.players[this.current];
const opp=this.players[1-this.current];
const potted = shot.potted; // object balls
const eight = potted.find(b=>b.type==='eight');
const scratch=shot.cueScratched;
let foul=false, reason='';
if (eight) {
  if (shot.isBreak) { toast('8-ball on the break','Table re-racked'); this.reRack(); return; }
  const cleared = shot.context.cleared;
  if (!cleared || scratch || !shot.firstHit || shot.firstHit.type !== 'eight') {
    this.endGame(1-this.current, 'Eight-ball pocketed too early'); return;
