}
```
Wait: if firstHit is 8 and cleared, legitimate. If firstHit is not 8 but 8 potted, loss. If firstHit null and 8 potted (crazy), loss.
- If scratch and 8 potted -> loss. Covered.
- If 8 potted on break -> re-rack, regardless of scratch. (Miniclip may spot the 8; re-rack is clean.)

Then determine foul:
```js
if (!shot.firstHit) { foul=true; reason='No ball was struck'; }
if (scratch) { foul=true; reason='Cue ball pocketed'; }
if (!shot.isBreak) {
  const group = shot.context.group;
  if (shot.firstHit) {
    const ft=shot.firstHit.type;
    if (group) {
      if (ft==='eight') { if (!shot.context.cleared) {foul=true; reason='The 8-ball was struck first';} }
      else if (ft !== group) { foul=true; reason='Wrong ball struck first'; }
    } else {
      if (ft==='eight') { foul=true; reason='The 8-ball was struck first'; }
    }
