if (p.group) ownPotted = potted.some(b=>b.type===p.group);
else if (this.tableOpen) ownPotted = potted.length>0; // open table (break or no group)
```
On break, any potted => continue if legal. Actually after break potted but tableOpen remains true. Fine.
- If foul:
